dget');\n\n        // ava's hero has no docked mockup slot, so the widget always lives\n        // as the floating bottom-right bubble instead of docking inline.\n        document.body.classList.add('hero-gone');\n\n        // Dynamically load the platform widget using Javascript to keep HTML clean and lightweight\n        va",
